    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to introduce this impressive three-bedroom extended semi-detached property to the market, ideally positioned in the peaceful cul-de-sac of Colthurst Mews, Lucan. This superb home enjoys a highly convenient location within easy walking distance of Ballyowen Shopping Centre, a selection of well-regarded schools, and an excellent range of sporting and leisure amenities. Both Lucan Village and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre are just a short drive away, while frequent Dublin Bus services, with a stop only a couple of minutes' walk from the property, provide excellent access to the city centre. The nearby M50 motorway also offers seamless connectivity to Dublin Airport and the surrounding road network. Internal living accommodation of c. 94 Sqm can be found here and in brief consists of; Entrance hallway with guest WC, living room, and a bright, extended and fully refitted open-plan kitchen/diner to the ground floor. Upstairs features three spacious bedrooms, including a master bedroom with a en-suite, along with a refitted family bathroom. Externally, the property enjoys a fully enclosed east-facing rear garden with side access to the front which offers a driveway for off road parking. No. 14 comes to the market in excellent decorative order, having been carefully maintained and tastefully enhanced by its current owners. Additional features include gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows throughout, and an enviable setting within this quiet, family-friendly, and highly desirable development. Given the strong demand for properties in this sought-after location, we anticipate significant interest. Early viewing is highly recommended—contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today to register your interest.\n\n\nKey Features\n\nBER C1\nc.94 Sqm\nSought after development\nSemi Detached\nCul de sac location\nExtended to rear\nThree Bedrooms\nThree Bath\nGas central heating\nClose to shops, schools and major road networks\nViewing is highly advised!\n\nDirections\nK78 TY07\n"
      },
      {
